      "title": "Add unit coverage for the new ping helper",
      "impact": "The new ping_worker helper has input validation, timeout handling, subprocess argument construction, and return-code mapping, but the diff adds no tests. A regression in any of those branches, including accepting invalid hosts/counts or returning the wrong boolean on timeout/nonzero exit, would ship without a failing test.",
      "fix": "Add focused Python unit tests for ping_worker, using unittest.mock for subprocess.run to cover empty/dash-prefixed hosts, count below 1, count above MAX_PING_COUNT, TimeoutExpired returning False, nonzero returncode returning False, zero returncode returning True, and the expected argv/timeout passed to subprocess.run."
    }
